message: "If you use these drive-time measures, please cite them as below. Each release has its own DOI on Zenodo."
type: dataset
title: "Rural and Frontier Perinatal Care Access Layer: County Drive-Time Measures to Perinatal Care Service Types"
version: "0.1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24206837"
