license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/memesobum/perinatal-access-layer"
abstract: >-
  Open drive-time estimates from population-weighted Census block group centers to the nearest hospital providing
  labor and delivery care, the nearest substance use treatment facility serving pregnant or postpartum women, and
  the nearest HRSA health center site, computed on OpenStreetMap roads and summarized for every U.S. county as the
  share of women aged 15 to 44 beyond 30 and 60 minutes, with rural and frontier results.
keywords:
  - perinatal behavioral health
  - travel time
  - geographic access
  - obstetric care
  - substance use treatment
  - rural health
  - frontier
  - OpenStreetMap
